            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An anatomical system composed of mineralized tissue and consisting of the internal support structure (internal skeleton) of an animal providing shape, support, and protection to the body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
